  npcId: sam
  title: The Book and the Barrels
  summary: 'Sam is a shy writer stuck on an autumn novel, who works three mornings a week at the treatment plant and sees what the tower throws away. Linked to Rosa''s soup: Part 5 needs Rosa''s Part 7. Fork: publish an expose about the plant, or finish the novel and pass the notes to Marcus.'
  pathAName: Publish the expose
  pathBName: Finish the novel
  parts:
