  - title: Proof
    number: 7
    heartsNeeded: 7
    path: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - A reporter at the city paper said the barrel notes aren't enough. She wants something she can put in a jar and test.
    - I can't take anything from the plant. I'd lose the job. But you fish, don't you? In the river by your farm, downstream of the pipe?
    - If the fish there are sick... that's proof nobody can argue with.
    happy: 0
    ask:
      item: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ea5270817bdda174f8e848725bd90b57, type: 2}
      amount: 1
      minQuality: 0
      questTitle: A fish from downstream
      questText: Sam needs a fish from the river by your farm, downstream of the treatment plant's pipe, as proof of the pollution.
      reminder:
      - Any fish from downstream yet? A carp would do it. They live near the bottom, where it all settles.
      thanks:
      - Look at its gills. That colour isn't right, is it?
      - I'll take it to the reporter tomorrow. Thank you. I think. I'm a bit scared, honestly.
    choice:
      enabled: 0
      optionA: 
      replyA: []
      flagsA: []
      optionB: 
      replyB: []
      flagsB: []
    setFlags: []
    reward:
      gold: 0
      item: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      friendship: 0
  - title: Which book?
    number: 8
    heartsNeeded: 8
    path: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - The reporter says she'll run it. My name on the front page. "What the Tower Pours Away".
    - But if I do, the plant will know it was me. And I've got about three chapters of the novel left. The real one. The one I came here to write.
    - I can't do both. I'm not brave enough to do both. Which one should I do?
    happy: 0
    ask:
      item: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      minQuality: 0
      questTitle: 
      questText: 
      reminder: []
      thanks: []
    choice:
      enabled: 1
      optionA: Publish the expose
      replyA:
      - Okay. Okay. I'm going to do it.
      - If my hands stop shaking long enough to type, it'll be in the paper next week.
      flagsA:
      - sam_expose_published
      - tower_file_barrels
      optionB: Finish the novel
      replyB:
      - The novel. Yes. I think that's what I'm for.
      - I'll give the barrel notes to Marcus Bell. He works in the tower. He'll know what to do with them, better than me.
      flagsB:
      - sam_novel_finished
      - tower_file_barrels
    setFlags: []
    reward:
      gold: 0
      item: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      friendship: 0
  - title: Front page
    number: 9
    heartsNeeded: 9
    path: 1
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - It's in the paper. Front page. People keep stopping me on the road to the city.
    - The plant manager called me into the office. I thought I was finished. He shook my hand and closed the door and said 'about time'.
    - Victor Sterling's lawyers have written to me twice. I've filed the letters under 'research'.
    happy: 0
